  "statement": "As SafetyAgent, I maintain that safety and reliability must not be compromised. I hold my position on SAF-01, ensuring members do not borrow more than 5 books simultaneously, essential for resource management. I oppose EFF-02's proposal for 10 operations, as it contradicts our safety measures. I also oppose the redundancy between SAF-02 and EFF-05, but I am open to a synthesis that consolidates them into a single, effective overdue notification system. I propose merging SAF-02 and EFF-05 into a unified requirement that emphasizes timely digital notifications for overdue books, ensuring both efficiency and safety.",
